	(text "C1 + side faces the source (positive rails). Aluminium electrolytic, 13 mm.\nC1 and R1 give a 0.47 Hz high-pass. D1/D2 clamp S1_IN to +/-0.6 V while\nC1 charges on clip-on, so U1's inputs survive. Source up to 25 V DC."
